# The canonical word database: ~300MB and fully rebuildable from
# build_etymology_db.py. Committing it would make diffs meaningless and
# pushes painful (GitHub already warns about wikt_words.json at 59MB).
# Use `python build_etymology_db.py --sample 20000` for a dev copy in minutes.
etymology.db
etymology.db-wal
etymology.db-shm
# Scratch file the build writes to before swapping it into place -- present
# only mid-build, or left behind when the swap is blocked by a running app.py.
etymology.db.new
